AU  - Khosla, Megha
TI  - User Fairness in Recommender Systems
PY  - 2018
UR  - https://arxiv.org/pdf/1807.06349
N1  - arXiv:1807.06349
AB  - Recent works in recommendation systems have focused on diversity in recommendations as an important aspect of recommendation quality. In this work we argue that the post-processing algorithms aimed at only improving diversity among recommendations lead to discrimination among the users.
ER  -
